            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Well, ok, here's what I'll do for now\n\n```python\nif cython.compiled:\n    from cython.cimports.cpython.ref import PyObject, _Py_REFCNT, Py_REFCNT\nelse:\n    PyObject = type(object)\n    def Py_REFCNT(ob):\n        return 1\n    _Py_REFCNT = Py_REFCNT\n```\n\nIt seems weird that I have to. Just replacing every Cy-only importable with a no-op for pure Python would be convenient.",
